/* ABI baseline export whitelist (docs/modules/25-abi-baseline.md §5-T2, rulings #12/#2).
   Only the public C API leaves the library; cxxbridge1$/rust internals become LOCAL,
   killing same-name shared exports across .so files (ODR/interposition class). */
{
  global:
    mediaservo_*;
  local:
    *;
};
